sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be MeterValues
    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop For every EVSE
        CS->>CSMS: MeterValuesRequest (evseId omitted, meterValue[0].sampledValue.context = Trigger)
        CSMS-->>CS: MeterValuesResponse
    end
